<title>USA: Weeks files $600 mln debt, equity shelf.</title>
<headline>Weeks files $600 mln debt, equity shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weeks Corp filed Monday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to register a shelf offering of up to $300 million in preferred and common stock and up to $300 million in debt securities to be issued by Weeks Realty LP.</p>
<p>The Norcross, Ga, real estate investment trust said proceeds from the sale will be used for general corporate purposes, which may include acquiring additional industrial and office properties and repaying outstanding debt.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the offering.</p>
</text>
